== Expression Errors

Simple math: #(1 + 2) works fine

Missing closing paren: #(5 + 3

Unexpected token: #(1 + )

Just garbage: #(+++---)

Missing opening paren: #5 + 3)

Empty expression: #()

== Nested Formatting Errors

This is *bold with _italic inside but italic unclosed

This is _italic with *bold inside* but italic unclosed

This is *bold with `code inside but code unclosed

== Complex Expression Errors

Unterminated in nested context: #(1 + (2 * 3)

Multiple operators: #(5 ++ 3)

Division by text: #(10 / hello)

== String Errors in Expressions

Bad string literal: #("unterminated string)

